16. AUDIO BRIDGE
==================================================

TWILIO → LYZR:

Twilio base64 μ-law 8 kHz
→ decode G.711 μ-law
→ signed PCM16 8 kHz
→ resample to Lyzr sample rate (normally 24 kHz)
→ send to Lyzr WebSocket in the exact documented/observed frame format

LYZR → TWILIO:

Lyzr PCM16
→ resample to 8 kHz PCM16
→ encode G.711 μ-law
→ base64
→ send:

{
  "event": "media",
  "streamSid": "...",
  "media": {
    "payload": "<base64 mulaw>"
  }
}

Never prepend WAV headers.

Never write audio to disk.

Never spawn ffmpeg per frame.

